  "own_design": [
    "Private nonpersistent native WebKit pages behind an authenticated no-failover CONNECT proxy with screened DNS and numeric-address tunnels.",
    "Exact attached target WebSocket only; no target enumeration, browser-wide attachment or cookie API.",
    "Fixed own scripts in isolated worlds, JSON data parameters, origin preconditions and snapshot/element CAS adjacent to the effect.",
    "Downloads return bounded in-memory bytes/hash to the central host; no automatic disk writes or WebKit downloads.",
    "One operation ID is consumed before dispatch. Managed cancellation/reset retain evaluation custody until the actual WebKit reply or process-termination evidence; transport cancellation cannot replay uncertain actions or undo site effects."
  ],
