    "Existing browser network policy remains owned by its browser; attachment does not apply the managed WebKit proxy to an external profile.",
    "Disconnecting an attached CDP page closes only Jarvis transport, not previously dispatched site code or the external target. A managed evaluation that never returns retains custody instead of fabricating cleanup."
